16,"data":217},"aQjJqBMAACEAYWxt","makaymadagascar","\u002Fexpedition\u002Fmakaymadagascar","expedition","https:\u002F\u002Fnico-mathieux.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=afp4thAAAPzZYtHr&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aQjJqBMAACEAYWxt%22%29+%5D%5D",[],"2025-11-03T15:29:24+0000","2026-01-28T16:27:46+0000",[214],"makay",[],[],{"title":218,"date":219,"place":220,"gpx_file":221,"gpx_color":5,"youtube_link":227,"slices":230,"meta_title":376,"meta_description":377,"meta_image":378},"Makay","2023-09-12","Madagascar",{"link_type":66,"key":222,"kind":68,"id":223,"url":224,"name":225,"size":226},"595129f8-fb35-4e0d-89b3-b4d72c2ed764","aQjXtbpReVYa39aT","https:\u002F\u002Fnico-mathieux.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fnico-mathieux\u002FaQjXtbpReVYa39aT_exped-makay.gpx","exped-makay.gpx","822456",{"link_type":32,"key":228,"url":229,"target":35},"20cd0416-625b-4ae4-a35e-a35a01e476cc","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.youtube.com\u002Fwatch?v=HAE6kMMQvQI",[231,244,283,339,349,367],{"variation":101,"version":102,"items":232,"primary":233,"id":242,"slice_type":243,"slice_label":5},[],{"numbers":234,"shop_related":18},[235,238],{"number":236,"unit":5,"description":237},"12","Jours",{"number":239,"unit":240,"description":241},"319","km","Distance","numbers_list$3dc07c4c-8c54-4a98-bac0-4b5f473162d4","numbers_list",{"variation":101,"version":102,"items":245,"primary":246,"id":281,"slice_type":282,"slice_label":5},[],{"title":247,"subtitle":248,"text":249,"link":269,"image":273,"image_place":218,"image_date":280,"inverted":18,"shop_related":18},"À propos","Le Makay",[250,254,257,260,263,266],{"type":251,"text":252,"spans":253,"direction":79},"paragraph","Le Massif du Makay, est un véritable labyrinthe de canyons, de montagnes et de plateaux arides sculptés par l’érosion. Ce massif, isolé et difficile d’accès, abrite l’une des biodiversités les plus riches et les plus préservées de Madagascar.",[],{"type":251,"text":255,"spans":256,"direction":79}," Entre déserts de sable, falaises abruptes, oasis verdoyantes et rivières encaissées, le Makay forme un monde à part, presque hors du temps.",[],{"type":251,"text":258,"spans":259,"direction":79}," Des traces de civilisations anciennes y ont été découvertes, notamment des peintures rupestres et des vestiges de camps témoignant du passage de populations ayant vécu en harmonie avec cet environnement hostile.",[],{"type":251,"text":261,"spans":262,"direction":79}," Aujourd’hui encore, quelques communautés locales vivent à proximité, pratiquant l’élevage et la culture sur brûlis, tout en perpétuant des traditions ancestrales. ",[],{"type":251,"text":264,"spans":265,"direction":79},"Sur le plan biologique, le Makay est un sanctuaire unique : on y trouve des grenouilles endémiques, de nombreuses espèces de caméléons, geckos, serpents et même des lémuriens qui n’existent nulle part ailleurs.",[],{"type":251,"text":267,"spans":268,"direction":79}," Chaque canyon cache une flore et une faune particulières, adaptées à la sécheresse ou à l’humidité des zones d’ombre. Ce massif, souvent qualifié de « dernier paradis sauvage de Madagascar », représente un trésor pour la recherche scientifique et un symbole de la lutte pour la préservation des écosystèmes fragiles de l’île.",[],{"link_type":270,"key":271,"text":272},"Any","5a952a30-606e-44a7-ad18-90fd8406c126","Découvrir",{"dimensions":274,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":277,"id":278,"edit":279},{"width":275,"height":276},4240,2832,"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fnico-mathieux\u002FaQja7LpReVYa39dZ_DSC07020.JPG?auto=format,compress","aQja7LpReVYa39dZ",{"x":28,"y":28,"zoom":29,"background":30},"2023-09-27","title_text_image$aea1b051-0eba-4589-9c65-6a1e116b7e7e","title_text_image",{"variation":101,"version":102,"items":284,"primary":285,"id":337,"slice_type":338,"slice_label":5},[],{"images":286,"shop_related":18},[287,294,300,306,312,319,325,331],{"image":288,"place":5,"date":5},{"dimensions":289,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":291,"id":292,"edit":29